Right.  And how much trouble did you have on that trip such that you
required warning of anything?  :)

(Rodney will eventually level himself up to a 5 if you see him enough;
remember, his level increases every time you kill him.)

>> This is somewhat intentional -- if warning was as useful as ESP, for
