Most early-game characters should be encountering monsters that are all
three: below, at, and possibly slightly above their level.  This would
give them a four-character range.

The purpose of a '5' for _any_ character is to indicate "SOMETHING
LARGE, MEAN, AND NASTY IS HERE AND IT SHOULD KILL YOU."  You shouldn't see
many of these... unless there's a polymorph trap, of course, in which
case warning will serve its thematic purpose perfectly.

